        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Key Factors Impacting Price"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Tear-off and disposal: Removing multiple old layers of shingles adds labor and dump fees."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Roof pitch and complexity:\nSteep slopes, multiple peaks, and tight angles require extra safety gear and time."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Decking repair: Rotted or damaged wood plywood found underneath old shingles must be replaced."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Location:\nUrban areas like Salt Lake County often feature higher contractor rates than rural counties."
